  {
    "hotel_id": "64310",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/oriental-central-hotel/hotel/hanoi-vn.html",
    "name": "Lavender Central Hotel Hanoi",
    "detail": "I cannot say enough about how excellent our experience was at Oriental Central Hotel. If you're looking for a friendly, clean and comfortable stay in the Old Quarter in Hanoi then you can't get better than this. The staff were super friendly (and genuine), very helpful, very giving and are one of the nicest people we've met in Vietnam, especially Mary, Thomas and the staff on reception. We stayed there on NYE and when we checked out the staff gave us a gift in celebration of the new year (Vietnamese coffee and filter) such a lovely touch and it made us feel really valued - thank you :) Small little things like that make the holiday experience all the more sweet. In regards to the hotel amenities itself, it's a small boutique hotel but they take care of it really well. The rooms are on the small side but it's very clean and has all the necessary equipment for a very comfortable stay. The beds and pillows were comfortable, the bathroom clean and spacious. On arrival you get some extras like free fruit plate and bags of chips - again, these extra small touches really make a difference in feeling like you found a gem in the middle of busy Hanoi. We stayed in three different hotels while we were in Hanoi and this was by far (very far) the best hotel. It was just a shame that they were booked out those other days we wanted to stay so had to find alternatives. Highly recommend this hotel so enjoy it like we did.",
    "area": "Old Quarter,Hanoi - View on map",
